yaml/anchor
description: An &name before a value — names the node so an alias can share it
- >
  An **anchor** `&name` before a value NAMES the node; an
  [alias](::language:01-Concretes_2:01-yaml:01-yaml_code:01-yaml_scalar:04-yaml_alias) `*name`
  elsewhere then stands for the very same node — sharing, not copying. Any value can be
  anchored — a scalar as well as a mapping, and sequence elements too:
- !!<format: text/x-yaml> |
  boss: &chief {name: Rex}
  team:
    lead: *chief
